Package: ISPaL
Type: Package
Title: Periodic Forecasting with Exogenous Variables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Thiago", family = "Lappicy", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "lappicy@gmail.com"),
      person(given = "Carlos H. R.", family = "Lima", role = "aut"))
Description: Provides a framework for monthly periodic forecasting with PAR,
    PARX and RIDGE models and exogenous variables. The package includes the
    original forecasting functions, example streamflow and climate datasets,
    and a self-contained Shiny dashboard for importing data, configuring and
    running models, inspecting results, exporting tables and creating metric
    plots.
URL: https://github.com/Lappicy/ISPaL
